     * a few names are stale (swaziland, east-timor, republic-of-macedonia). null
     * means nothing is bundled — Country::getFlagUrlAttribute() falls back.
     *
     * `title` and `nationality` carry every locale LanguagesSeeder ships, enabled
     * or not, so turning a language on needs no data work. Demonyms are the
